{"name": "Ski-E-O! Ski Resort Tycoon", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"362\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/909c8945c1ebe50fcb5c52c1ab3a08f6.avif?t=1794506830\" width=\"1527\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build the Legendary Ski Resort you've always dreamed of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You start with just a ticket office and a bit of cash. Transform an empty mountain into a Legendary Resort in this management tycoon game from an industry veteran and passionate skier.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/2935a4d110c25cb1d738d5a109779fcd.poster.avif?t=1794506830\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/2935a4d110c25cb1d738d5a109779fcd.webm?t=1794506830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/2935a4d110c25cb1d738d5a109779fcd.mp4?t=1794506830\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"362\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/fd1b475e40d7d187d5f33a0b5aeb12b9.avif?t=1794506830\" width=\"1527\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No rigid grid system. Paint trails directly onto terrain built from real LiDAR data from around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You need a variety of trails for all types of skiers: green circles for beginners, black diamonds for the brave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build cozy ski villages with lodges, restaurants, apr\u00e8s bars, shopping, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"350\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/3a208b598ac657e9fe6126c238397813.poster.avif?t=1794506830\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/3a208b598ac657e9fe6126c238397813.webm?t=1794506830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/3a208b598ac657e9fe6126c238397813.mp4?t=1794506830\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"362\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/c9b4e7e618ec8ecb380e23a4d67aa8b9.avif?t=1794506830\" width=\"1527\"/></span>See to the needs of thousands of guests as they arrive at your resort - everyone wants something different, so make sure to keep them happy. Some are there to chill, others are there to shred. <br/><i>Watch a Jerry wipe out on an expert trail he had no business entering! And make sure you have enough Ski Patrol hired to help him out after you\u2019re done laughing.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras_big/778d1d2420ffd8a2a1ff383152a45630.avif?t=1794506830\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/778d1d2420ffd8a2a1ff383152a45630.avif?t=1794506830\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not everyone came to ski! Place buildings that satisfy a variety of guests, from waffle stands to spas, warming huts to five-star hotels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/596ae5859cd4be3172204d50cf60b22a.poster.avif?t=1794506830\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/596ae5859cd4be3172204d50cf60b22a.webm?t=1794506830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/596ae5859cd4be3172204d50cf60b22a.mp4?t=1794506830\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"362\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/20b57475dfda6fc863bea425cb75fba8.avif?t=1794506830\" width=\"1527\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every peak is built from real-world elevation data: the actual ridgelines, fall lines, and the weather that comes with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/7ad0e71ebcabc755de5681800bb79b3c.poster.avif?t=1794506830\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/7ad0e71ebcabc755de5681800bb79b3c.webm?t=1794506830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/7ad0e71ebcabc755de5681800bb79b3c.mp4?t=1794506830\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Snow falls, settles, melts, and drifts on a GPU-simulated snowpack, and skiers carve real grooves into the powder as they go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An El Ni\u00f1o year turns the storms warm and wet. Snow turns to rain and wipes out your trails.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drought means running snowblowers around the clock just to stay open.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A big dump buries your buildings before the lifts even spin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A cool summer keeps your peaks soft and fluffy for the next season.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The East is cold and icy, with little natural snow. Run your snowmakers to keep your guests from wiping out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utah serves up light, consistent powder, the most forgiving place to build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Sierras flip between massive blizzards that bury your mountains and stubborn dry spells that melt what's there.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Colorado Rockies pair dependable snowfall with brutal, high-altitude cold that tests how warm you keep your guests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And the Pacific Northwest never stops dumping deep, heavy snow, keeping your groomers working overtime.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"813\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/04164be54e0d30d13cab66f433cee3c4.avif?t=1794506830\" width=\"1455\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play across every major ski region on Earth - from the five US regions to Japan, the Alps, the Andes, Canada, Australia and New Zealand, and China.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras_big/c5cef194a442f2bceaa3e9beb51ad1f0.avif?t=1794506830\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/c5cef194a442f2bceaa3e9beb51ad1f0.avif?t=1794506830\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "You're the Ski-E-O - build the cozy ski resort of your dreams in this management tycoon game. Adapt to ever-changing weather, paint trails, build lifts, and place the lodges and apr\u00e8s bars that keep thousands of skiers warm, fed, and happy.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/0188d1a232e5ab2c906e136031e52da8486cbe77/header.jpg?t=1794506830", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Early Access", "Simulation", "Management", "Building", "Funny", "Singleplayer"], "developers": "Falling Damage Games", "publishers": "Falling Damage Games", "release_date": "Nov 12, 2026", "price": "$17.99", "appid": "4493130", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "12 November 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/-GtsbUqp1Rw", "first_seen": 1794438000.0, "review_rank": 7}